sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employee
  participant UI as React Web App
  participant API as API Routers + Auth&RBAC
  participant CH as Chat/Workflow Service
  participant CO as Workflow Coordinator
  participant AX as AgentStepExecutor
  participant KS as Knowledge Service (BM25)
  participant LLM as LLM Client
  participant G as Gemini API
  participant DB as Repository / PostgreSQL
  E->>UI: Hỏi "Làm thêm giờ ngày lễ được trả bao nhiêu?"
  UI->>API: POST /api/chat/ask + JWT
  API->>CH: ask(actor, workflow_id, question)
  CH->>DB: INSERT workflow_run(running) + step_runs(pending, snapshot) + activity_log
  CH-->>CO: schedule_run(run_id) (background)
  CH-->>UI: 202 Accepted {run_id}
  CO->>DB: claim step_run pending→in_progress (input_context)
  CO->>AX: execute(step, context)
  AX->>DB: get Agent config (role, instruction, model, knowledge_collection)
  AX->>KS: retrieve("noi-quy", question, top_k=4)
  KS->>DB: load chunks (cached BM25 index, invalidated on upload)
  KS-->>AX: top chunks + scores (Điều 10. Làm thêm giờ …)
  AX->>LLM: generate(system prompt + question + [Nguồn n] chunks)
  LLM->>G: HTTPS generateContent (timeout 30 s)
  alt transient error (timeout / 429 / 5xx)
    G-->>LLM: error
    LLM-->>AX: LLMError(kind)
    AX->>LLM: automatic retry (exactly once)
    LLM->>G: HTTPS generateContent
  end
  G-->>LLM: answer text
  LLM-->>AX: LLMResult(text, usage, latency)
  AX-->>CO: StepResult(done, text, sources, attempts)
  CO->>DB: step_run=done, workflow_run=completed, final_result(text, sources)
  loop every 1 s until final
    UI->>API: GET /api/workflow-runs/{run_id}
    API-->>UI: status + answer + sources
  end
  UI-->>E: Câu trả lời + trích dẫn [Nguồn 1] Điều 10
